ck  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     HER 2 neu gene in tumor cells  REMOVED_DATE  Not Amplified    See note     Note  Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER 2 signals  156  to  chromosome 17 signals  110  in 60 tumor cell nuclei  A ratio of greater than  2 0 or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  neu gene amplification adjusted for  chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis     The results at or near the cutoff point  ranging from REMOVED_DATE   2 2  should be  interpreted with caution  Equivocal Amplification   Reference  Journal of  Clinical Oncology 25 118 145   REMOVED_CASE_ID        Addendum  2 by Atul K Bhan M D   Electronically signed on Wednesday REMOVED_MONTH  23   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 12 13 36PM  By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final  Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed  or corrected the diagnoses     PART A  Breast  Left   Excision  PART B  Breast  Right   Excision  PART C  Lymph Node  Right Axilla   Sentinel    Excision  PART D  Axillary Skin  Right   PART E  Breast  Right  Deep Margin   Excision  PART F  Breast  Right  Medial Margin   Excision  PART G  Breast  Right  Lateral Margin   Excision  PART H  Breast  Right  In       report_end  , Unchecked.
