ssay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  10 AUG 98 at 13 19 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number only  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 3cm fibroadipose tissue  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal a red pink  stellate region measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm and extending grossly to within 0 3cm of the inked margin  A representative section is frozen as FX  1 and resubmitted in cassettes A  Sections B through D are representative sections of the tumor  C D tumor nearest margin   Representative section of the breast parenchyma away from the tumor is submitted in cassette E  Other sections are in F J  Gross Description by  GUILLERMO J TEARNEY  MD Resident  MARYAM S  MOHAMMADKHANI  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1   BREAST   EXTENSIVE DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU WITH AREA HIGHLY SUSPICIOUS FOR INVASION  O R  Resident  GUILLERMO J TEARNEY  MD O R  Diagnosis by  ESTHER OLIVA  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michael Ned Margolies  M D  Priscilla Slanetz  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
