y in I through S  Labeled  right axilla nodes   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm piece of fatty tissue  from which multiple tan  rubbery lymph nodes  ranging from REMOVED_DATE to 1 0cm are dissected  portions of these lymph nodes are submitted in T through V  Labeled  Level II   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm piece of fatty tissue  from which two lymph nodes  each 0 3cm  is dissected  The nodes are submitted in W  and the remainder in X  Resident  Joseph Misdraji  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1 2  BREAST RIGHT  BIOPSY  INFILTRATING   INTRADUCTAL CARCINOMA  SOME IS COMEDO  TYPE   CARCINOMA APPROACHES TO WITHIN 0 1CM OF DEEP MARGIN  O R  Resident  RICHARD S  HAMILTON  HMS O R  Diagnosis by  Judith Ann Ferry  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  RIGHT BREAST TISSUE PART B  ADDITIONAL LATERAL   POSTERIOR MARGINS  RIGHT BREA PART C  AXILLA NODES  RIGHT  PART D  LEVEL II , Unchecked.
