ions from the firmer areas  including the inked margins are submitted serially from lateral medial aspect  SECTION CODE  A C  lateral region D I  central region  including representative skin J K  medial region  Labeled  right axillary contents   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm piece of fibroadipose tissue  containing multiple lymph nodes  ranging in greatest dimension from REMOVED_DATE to 2 2cm  The lymph nodes are soft and have white tan to tan yellow cut surfaces  Representative half of each lymph node and representative fibroadipose tissue are submitted in L through P  Resident  Metin Ozdemirli  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  AMBULATORY GEN SURGICAL   ACC 4 REPORTS TO  Herbert Charles Hoover Jr   M D  PART A  AXILLARY CONTENTS PART B  RIGHT BREAST , Unchecked.
