tion margins  Section Code  A  closest inked resection margin to biopsy cavity  deep  RSS  B E  biopsy cavity  RSS  F  medial breast parenchyma  suspicious  RSS  G  lateral breast parenchyma  suspicious  RSS  H  additional suspicious areas from mid portion of breast  RSS  I  areolar nipple  complex  RSS  J  skin in puckered region of lateral breast  RSS  Also received are two portions of skin and attached underlying soft tissue  The first is REMOVED_DATE x 5 0cm excised to a maximum depth of 2 0cm  Eccentrically located on the irregular skin ellipse is a REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm pale tan macule with a stuck on appearance  The second piece of skin and soft tissue is 20 x 7 0cm and excised to a maximum depth of 1 2cm  The epidermal surface is remarkable for multiple tan macules and patches ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE to 1 0cm in maximum dimension  Representative sections of the first piece are found in K and the second in L  Gross Description by  Timothy R  Quinn  MD Resident  EDI BROGI  MD  PhD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Wiley W Souba Jr   M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT    report_end  , Unchecked.
