Accession Number   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Report Status  FinalType  Surgical Pathology Pathology Report   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  OPERATION DATE  17 REMOVED_MONTH 03 ACCESSIONED ON  17 REMOVED_MONTH 03 at 13 15 CLINICAL DATA  History of DCIS positive at margins                                                                                      FINAL DIAGNOSIS     BREAST  RIGHT   RE EXCISION  FOCAL DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  GRADE 2  REMOVED_DATE CM FROM THE ANTERIOR MARGIN  HEALING BIOPSY SITE  MULTIPLE LEVELS EXAMINED  BREAST  RIGHT  FINAL SHAVED LATERAL REMOVED_DATE CAVITY   EXCISION  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  BREAST  RIGHT  FINAL SHAVED MEDIAL REMOVED_DATE CAVITY   EXCISION  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  Diagnosis by  MELINDA J  FAN  MD Signed On  24 REMOVED_MONTH 03 at 18 15                                                                                 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast re excision   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 9cm lumpectomy specimen  The specimen is inked as follows  anterior blue  posterior black  medial green  lateral yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned from inferior to superior to reveal a heterogenous cut surface that consists mainly of a poorly circumscribed white tan firm are consistent with prior biopsy site  The specimen is submitted from inferior to superior in cassettes A J  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast final shaved margin  lateral   are two pieces of unoriented fibroadipose tissue  The larger measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  the smaller measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  The specimens are sectioned  and entirely submitted in cassettes K and L  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast final shaved margin  medial   is one piece of unoriented fibroadipose tissue meas