rcent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  23 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 09 32 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm breast fragment with ill defined REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm white  firm lesion  less than 0 1cm from inked margin  The lesion is submitted in cassette A and B and the remainder of the specimen entirely in cassettes D L  Resident  STEPHEN LAU  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  BREAST  RIGHT  BIOPSY  SMALL HIGHLY SUSPICIOUS LESION  AWAIT PERMANENTS  O R  Resident  MARYAM S  MOHAMMADKHANI  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Judith Ann Ferry  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH OUTPATIENT  OFF P CLINIC  REPORTS TO  Leslie Wayne Ottinger  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
