ceptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  30 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 15 27 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh for Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  left breast  are two fragments of breast tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal a tan white focally yellow slightly nodular cut surface  No area is grossly suspicious for invasive carcinoma  Entirely submitted  The larger piece is in A J  and the smaller piece is in K M  Resident  ERIN OCHOA  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION  GROSS ONLY  NO AREAS GROSSLY SUSPICIOUS FOR INVASIVE CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  Simon Bergman  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Robin E  Kirby  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   LEFT BREAST BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
